{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345570/extras/31017efd2e9bbb698d69dde62ca3b020.poster.avif?t=1769855923\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345570/extras/31017efd2e9bbb698d69dde62ca3b020.webm?t=1769855923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345570/extras/31017efd2e9bbb698d69dde62ca3b020.mp4?t=1769855923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mad Toys, your mission is to defend the moving train </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by engaging in intense battles against the pursuing enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while also managing resources such as refilling ammo and repairing damages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At pit stops, replenish supplies and purchase crucial upgrades to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >enhance the train's capabilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each run, collect resources to upgrade the train, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making it powerful enough to defeat the invading enemy and save the realm.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345570/extras/ef7d728b3cb91e0ef5678a079fd581ef.webp?t=1769855923\" width=413 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your decision-making skills with  management tasks, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from resource allocation to target prioritization, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shaping the outcome of your battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p